{"nusach":"sefard","id":"sheva_berachot","sections":[{"title":{"he":"שבע ברכות","en":"Sheva Berachot"},"segments":[{"key":"Y8io-3qx-O","he":[[{"t":"בשבע ברכות שלאחר ברכת המזון מתחילים כאן, ומסיימים בבורא פרי הגפן:","s":"n"}]],"en":"After Birkat HaMazon, the Seven Berachot begin here and end with the blessing over the wine."},{"key":"TCAyFWzELk","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, שֶׁהַכֹּל בָּרָא לִכְבוֹדוֹ:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe Who created everything for His glory.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"hXnwQcQFcL","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, יוֹצֵר הָאָדָם:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe Former of man.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"6MKJUSuAEX","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, אֲשֶׁר יָצַר אֶת־הָאָדָם בְּצַלְמוֹ, בְּצֶֽלֶם דְּמוּת תַּבְנִיתוֹ, וְהִתְקִין לוֹ מִמֶּֽנּוּ בִּנְיַן עֲדֵי עַד. בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, יוֹצֵר הָאָדָם:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe Who formed man (Adam) in His image, in the image of His likeness; and fashioned for him out of his very self a building (a wife: Eve) for eternity. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Former of Man.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"5CY0sksBZZ","he":[[{"t":"שׂוֹשׂ תָּשִׂישׂ","s":"b"},{"t":" וְתָגֵל הָעֲקָרָה, בְּקִבּוּץ בָּנֶֽיהָ לְתוֹכָהּ בְּשִׂמְחָה. בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, מְשַׂמֵּֽחַ צִיּוֹן בְּבָנֶֽיהָ:"}]],"en":"May the barren one be happy and exult with the ingathering of her children into her midst with joy. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Who gladdens Zion through her children.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"auIPby-m9N","he":[[{"t":"שַׂמֵּֽחַ תְּשַׂמַּח","s":"b"},{"t":" רֵעִים הָאֲהוּבִים, כְּשַׂמֵּחֲךָ יְצִירְךָ בְּגַן עֵֽדֶן מִקֶּֽדֶם. בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, מְשַׂמֵּֽחַ חָתָן וְכַלָּה:"}]],"en":"Grant abundant joy to these beloved companions, as You gladdened Your created being in the Garden of Eden of old. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Who gladdens groom and bride.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"YA8YSMk7yV","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֶלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, אֲשֶׁר בָּרָא שָׂשׂוֹן וְשִׂמְחָה, חָתָן וְכַלָּה, גִּילָה רִנָּה, דִּיצָה וְחֶדְוָה, אַהֲבָה וְאַחֲוָה, וְשָׁלוֹם וְרֵעוּת. מְהֵרָה יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ יִשָּׁמַע בְּעָרֵי יְהוּדָה וּבְחוּצוֹת יְרוּשָׁלָֽיִם, קוֹל שָׂשׂוֹן, וְקוֹל שִׂמְחָה, קוֹל חָתָן וְקוֹל כַּלָּה, קוֹל מִצְהֲלוֹת חֲתָנִים מֵחֻפָּתָם, וּנְעָרִים מִמִּשְׁתֵּה נְגִינָתָם. בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, מְשַׂמֵּֽחַ חָתָן עִם הַכַּלָּה:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe, Who created happiness and joy, groom and bride, exultation, song, pleasure, delight, love, brotherhood, peace and companionship. Soon, Adonoy, our God, may there be heard in the cities of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem the sound of happiness and the sound of joy, the sound of the groom and sound of the bride, the sound of grooms' jubilation from their chupah, and of the youths from their feasts of song. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Who gladdens the groom with the bride.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"e0mOF8ZHh3","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, בּוֹרֵא פְּרִי הַגָּֽפֶן:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe Who creates the fruit of the vine."}]}],"credits":[{"title":"Siddur Sefard — The Metsudah Siddur, Avrohom Davis (1981)","license":"CC-BY","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Siddur_Sefard"}]}